# The assets are hashed byte for byte (see assets/stanford-bunny/README.md and
# assets/stanford-bunny-pbr/README.md): never convert their line endings on checkout or commit.
assets/** -text
# The PBR bunny's maps are binary; its model is never converted either. None of them passes
# through a filter (a contributor's global LFS rule must not turn one into a pointer). Its README
# is plain text.
assets/stanford-bunny-pbr/*.jpg binary -filter
assets/stanford-bunny-pbr/*.png binary -filter
assets/stanford-bunny-pbr/model.dae -text -filter
assets/stanford-bunny-pbr/README.md text
